# Privacy Policy — Everness Studio

**Developer:** GokuForge (`gokuforge@gmail.com`)  
**Repository:** https://github.com/goku-forge/everness-studio

Everness Studio is an offline-first mobile code studio. We respect your privacy and collect **zero** personal data.

## 1. No Ads, Trackers, or Analytics
Everness Studio contains no advertising SDKs, no analytics, and no background telemetry.

## 2. Local-Only Storage
All code files, SQLite databases, editor settings, AI chat history, and API keys are stored **locally on your device**. Nothing is uploaded to GokuForge servers.

## 3. Optional Network Requests
Everness Studio only connects to the internet when you explicitly trigger one of these actions:
- **AI Chat:** Your prompt and (if enabled) active file are sent directly from your device to the AI provider you configured (Google Gemini, Anthropic, OpenAI, OpenRouter, or your custom endpoint) using your own API key.
- **Package Installation (`pip install`):** Fetches Python packages from PyPI or the Pyodide CDN.
- **Update Check:** Checks `api.github.com/repos/goku-forge/everness-studio/releases/latest` for newer app releases.

## 4. Permissions & File Access
The app only requests standard `INTERNET` permission. Importing and saving files uses Android's system file picker so you choose exactly which files to open or export.

## 5. Donations & Feedback
- Optional donations via Google Pay / UPI are handled directly by your UPI app; Everness Studio never sees or stores payment details.
- Bug reports or reviews sent via **✉ Feedback & Review** open your own email app addressed to `gokuforge@gmail.com`.

## Contact
Questions or privacy concerns? Email **gokuforge@gmail.com**.
